$ Basis set library file automatically generatered by basis_set.py
$ 
$ invocation: basis_set.py --file=../basis/reference_edited/7s_tz_archive --print_polarization --print_scfbas --uncontracted --equal_exponent_threshold=0.05 --polarization_type=7s7p correlating,6s6p correlating,6s6p polarizing,5d correlating --output=dyall.7s.tz.bas
$ 
$ These are the sets of functions selected from the TCA archive (apart from SCF):
$  ['7s7p correlating', '6s6p correlating', '6s6p polarizing', '5d correlating']
$ 
$ dyall.7s.tz.bas
